#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:1
msgid "Arabic Parts (Hermetic Lots)"
msgstr "Parties arabes (Lots hermétiques)"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:3
msgid ""
"Arabic Parts — also called **Hermetic Lots** in classical astrology — are"
" sensitive points derived from the longitudes of chart positions rather "
"than from direct planetary observation. They were extensively used in "
"Hellenistic and Medieval astrology and remain central to traditional "
"practice."
msgstr ""
"Les parties arabes — également appelées **Lots hermétiques** en astrologie"
" classique — sont des points sensibles dérivés des longitudes des"
" positions du thème plutôt que de l'observation directe des planètes."
" Elles étaient largement utilisées en astrologie hellénistique et"
" médiévale et restent centrales à la pratique traditionnelle."

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:5
msgid "Ketu provides a sect-aware registry of parts via the `ketu.parts` module."
msgstr "Ketu fournit un registre de parties sensible à la sect via le module `ketu.parts`."

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:7
msgid "Built-in Parts"
msgstr "Parties intégrées"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:9
msgid "Three parts are registered by default:"
msgstr "Trois parties sont enregistrées par défaut :"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nom"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "Key"
msgstr "Clé"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "Sect-aware"
msgstr "Sensible à la sect"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "Formula (day)"
msgstr "Formule (jour)"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "Formula (night)"
msgstr "Formule (nuit)"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "Part of Fortune"
msgstr "Part de Fortune"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "`\"fortune\"`"
msgstr "`\"fortune\"`"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Oui"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "ASC + Moon - Sun"
msgstr "ASC + Lune - Soleil"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "ASC + Sun - Moon"
msgstr "ASC + Soleil - Lune"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "Part of Spirit"
msgstr "Part de l'Esprit"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "`\"spirit\"`"
msgstr "`\"spirit\"`"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "Part of Marriage"
msgstr "Part du Mariage"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "`\"marriage\"`"
msgstr "`\"marriage\"`"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "Non"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md
msgid "ASC + Venus - Saturn"
msgstr "ASC + Vénus - Saturne"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:17
msgid ""
"**Fortune and Spirit invert their formulas by sect:** in a day chart the "
"standard formula applies; in a night chart the formula is reversed (Sun "
"and Moon swap roles). Marriage is the same formula regardless of sect."
msgstr ""
"**La Fortune et l'Esprit inversent leurs formules selon la sect :** dans"
" un thème diurne la formule standard s'applique ; dans un thème nocturne"
" la formule est inversée (Soleil et Lune échangent leurs rôles). Le"
" Mariage utilise la même formule quelle que soit la sect."

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:19
msgid "Sect Detection"
msgstr "Détection de la sect"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:21
msgid ""
"`ketu.parts` uses `is_day_chart` from `ketu.charts` internally. The chart"
" passed to `calculate_part` carries its own `jd`, `lat`, and `lon` — Ketu"
" determines sect automatically from those values."
msgstr ""
"`ketu.parts` utilise `is_day_chart` de `ketu.charts` en interne. Le thème"
" transmis à `calculate_part` porte ses propres `jd`, `lat` et `lon` —"
" Ketu détermine la sect automatiquement à partir de ces valeurs."

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:23
msgid "calculate_part"
msgstr "calculate_part"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:29
msgid "Computes a single part and returns its ecliptic longitude (0–360°)."
msgstr "Calcule une seule partie et retourne sa longitude écliptique (0–360°)."

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:50
msgid "calculate_all_parts"
msgstr "calculate_all_parts"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:56
msgid ""
"Computes all registered parts at once. The result is a plain Python dict "
"mapping part name to longitude (float, degrees 0–360)."
msgstr ""
"Calcule toutes les parties enregistrées en une seule fois. Le résultat est"
" un dict Python ordinaire associant le nom de la partie à la longitude"
" (float, degrés 0–360)."

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:58
msgid "`parts=None` computes every registered part."
msgstr "`parts=None` calcule toutes les parties enregistrées."

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:59
msgid "Pass a list of keys to restrict the calculation."
msgstr "Passer une liste de clés pour restreindre le calcul."

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:79
msgid "Formula Signature"
msgstr "Signature de formule"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:81
msgid ""
"Every part formula (both day and night variants) must accept exactly four"
" positional arguments:"
msgstr ""
"Toute formule de partie (variantes jour et nuit) doit accepter exactement"
" quatre arguments positionnels :"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:87
msgid ""
"Even if a formula does not use all four arguments, they are always passed"
" in this order. Results are automatically normalised to [0°, 360°) by the"
" registry."
msgstr ""
"Même si une formule n'utilise pas les quatre arguments, ils sont toujours"
" transmis dans cet ordre. Les résultats sont automatiquement normalisés"
" vers [0°, 360°) par le registre."

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:89
msgid "Registering Custom Parts"
msgstr "Enregistrement de parties personnalisées"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:91
msgid "Use `register` to add a new part to the global registry:"
msgstr "Utiliser `register` pour ajouter une nouvelle partie au registre global :"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:112
msgid ""
"After registration, the new part is included in "
"`calculate_all_parts(chart)` automatically."
msgstr ""
"Après l'enregistrement, la nouvelle partie est incluse dans"
" `calculate_all_parts(chart)` automatiquement."

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:114
msgid "PartSpec and get_part"
msgstr "PartSpec et get_part"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:116
msgid "You can inspect any registered part:"
msgstr "Vous pouvez inspecter toute partie enregistrée :"

#: ../../source/arabic_parts.md:126
msgid ""
"`PartSpec` is a named-tuple-like object with fields: `name`, "
"`day_formula`, `night_formula`, `description`."
msgstr ""
"`PartSpec` est un objet de type tuple nommé avec les champs : `name`,"
" `day_formula`, `night_formula`, `description`."

